		{
			"id": "r1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Packing slip\n- Manufacturer / sterilization COCs\n- Travelers, inspection reports\n- PO and drawings already on file",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 280,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 168,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W04 \u00b7 Staged for Inspection (Monday)\n**Who:** QE / Engineering  \n**Where:** Quarantine\n\n- Parts wait in Quarantine for the inspection day.\n- Start the PRF (QF 7.4.3-02) from the template and fill Section 1: part info, quantity inspected (N/A, 100% or AQL), QDA.\n- Save it to `Inspection Forms\\` as `PRF <part#> Rev X.xlsx` (add `Lot X` when the same part and rev appear twice).\n\n[[W04 - Staged for Inspection (Monday)|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 974,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 288,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "r3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- QF 7.4.3-02 PRF, Section 1",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 974,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 72,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W02 \u00b7 Paperwork Gathered and Filed to the PO Folder\n**Who:** Operations (SOP Table 1, step 2)  \n**Where:** Quarantine / Box PO folder\n\n- Collect the packing slip, manufacturer COCs, sterilization COCs, travelers and vendor inspection reports.\n- Scan or save them into the PO folder in Box: `Shipping Docs\\`, `COCs\\`, `Drawings\\`.\n\n[[W02 - Paperwork Gathered and Filed to the PO Folder|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 234,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 260,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "p2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W03 \u00b7 Received into Quarantine in ERP\n**Who:** Operations  \n**Where:** Quarantine / ERP\n\n- Count and check the goods against the packing slip.\n- Sign and date the packing slip (\"No Discrepancies\" when clean).\n- Complete the receiving list QF 7.4.3-01: receiving date, location Quarantine, qty, lot, rev, mfg/exp/ster dates.\n- Receive the lot into ERP so ERP lot traceability starts (SOP 7.4.3 \u00a78.2).\n\n[[W03 - Received into Quarantine in ERP|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 608,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 243,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "r2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- QF 7.4.3-01 receiving list\n- Signed and dated packing slip\n- ERP receipt",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 582,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 136,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "hdr_title",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# QE Receiving Workflow \u2014 pallet to Completed Receiving\nEach row is one physical step. Left: what people do. Middle: the records it produces. Right: the automation embedded in that step.  Orange = physical / Operations \u00b7 Cyan = automation run \u00b7 Red = review and signatures \u00b7 Green = record filed \u00b7 Yellow = records \u00b7 Purple = code steps.  Overview note: [[QE Receiving Workflow]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -330,
			"width": 1620,
			"height": 150
		},
		{
			"id": "hdr_a",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Physical step (who / where)",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -150,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "hdr_b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Records produced",
			"x": 500,
			"y": -150,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "r0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Vendor packing slip",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 72,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "hdr_c",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Automation embedded in this step",
			"x": 1100,
			"y": -150,
			"width": 780,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "p0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W01 \u00b7 Parts Arrive at the Receiving Dock\n**Who:** Operations  \n**Where:** Receiving Dock (SOP 7.4.3 \u00a74.2)\n\n- Carrier delivers the pallet or boxes; they sit on the dock.\n- The vendor's packing slip (and sometimes certs) ships with the goods.\n\n[[W01 - Parts Arrive at the Receiving Dock|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -29,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 202,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "c1_3",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Project Map/01 Governance/File Access Rules.md",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 264,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 60
		},
		{
			"id": "c1_2",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Project Map/01 Governance/Folder Structure.md",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": 269,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 50
		},
		{
			"id": "c7_0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Project Map/01 Governance/Step 8 - Fill PRF Sections 2, 5, 6.md",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": 2740,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 80
		},
		{
			"id": "p7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W08 \u00b7 Routed for Signatures by Email\n**Who:** QE sends; Director of Operations / Engineering Reviewer / Quality Manager sign  \n**Where:** Email + Adobe\n\n- 2.6 = Yes (confidential Biologic): **Director of Operations** (Director of Operations) signs first.\n- 2.4 = Yes: Quality Manager initials (H29).\n- Section 6 discrepancies: **Engineering Reviewer** signs before Quality Manager.\n- **Quality Manager** gives the final review and acceptance (SOP Table 1, step 4).\n\n[[W08 - Routed for Signatures by Email|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2622,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "r7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Fully signed compiled package",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 2622,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 72,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W09 \u00b7 Filed to Completed Receiving\n**Who:** QE (confirm who files)  \n**Where:** PO folder in Box \u2192 `Completed Receiving\\`\n\n- Save the fully signed package into the PO's `Completed Receiving\\` subfolder.\n\n[[W09 - Filed to Completed Receiving|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2992,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 176,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "p9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W10 \u00b7 Released to Inventory or Returned\n**Who:** Operations (SOP Table 1, step 5)  \n**Where:** Quarantine \u2192 inventory location / vendor\n\n- Move the goods to the location the PRF disposition calls for (Raw Goods / Finished Goods) and transfer them in ERP.\n- Rejected goods: return to vendor or hold under SOP 8.3.\n\n[[W10 - Released to Inventory or Returned|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 3238,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 232,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "r9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- ERP location transfer\n- PO folder documentation updated",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 3238,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 104,
			"color": "3"
		},
