		},
		{
			"id": "c5_1",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Project Map/01 Governance/Step 3 - Compile the Receiving Package.md",
			"x": 1520,
			"y": 1603,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 95
		},
		{
			"id": "c5_0",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Project Map/01 Governance/Step 2.5 - Validate PRF Section 1 (Blocking Gate).md",
			"x": 1140,
			"y": 1603,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 95
		},
		{
			"id": "p4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W05 \u00b7 Physical Inspection, Dimensions and Testing\n**Who:** QE / Engineering (SOP Table 1, step 3)  \n**Where:** Quarantine inspection area, well lit (SOP \u00a76.5)\n\n- Sample per the AQL, or inspect 100%.\n- Measure the numbered critical dimensions on the drawing with calibrated tools.\n- Bench / DVT testing where required. For sterile packaging, check for foreign objects with the TAPPI chart (over 0.25 mm\u00b2 is rejected, SOP \u00a76.6).\n- Record the measurements in Section 3. Record comments, DVT reference and calibrated-tool info in Section 4. Save the PRF (xlsx + pdf).\n\n[[W05 - Physical Inspection, Dimensions and Testing|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1332,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 366,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "r4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- PRF Section 3 (measurements)\n- PRF Section 4 (engineer comments)",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 1332,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 104,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W06 \u00b7 Compile with the Automation\n**Who:** QE runs it (manually or in a Claude Code session)  \n**Where:** Desktop tools folder \u2192 PO folder\n\n- Run `python receive.py PO26-xxxx`.\n- Read the summary: Section 1 mismatches first, then each part's flags.\n\n[[W06 - Compile with the Automation|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1768,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 470,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "r5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Compiled package in `In-Progress Receiving\\`\n- PRF xlsx/pdf with Sections 2, 5, 6 filled\n- Manifest in Desktop `logs\\` (development aid only)",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 1768,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "r6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Signed compiled package (inspector)",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 2236,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 72,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "p6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## W07 \u00b7 Engineer Review and Sign\n**Who:** QE / Engineering  \n**Where:** Adobe (compiled PDF)\n\n- Open the compiled package and resolve every flag.\n- Check the Section 2 answers; edit the Section 5 draft as needed.\n- Sign the inspector signature and date in Adobe.\n\n[[W07 - Engineer Review and Sign|Open step note \u2192]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 2308,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 244,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
